  "ruleText": "Cub 205.04 Issuance and Publication of Declaratory Rulings. Declaratory rulings issued by the board shall be filed pursuant to RSA 541-A:16, II (b), and edited subject to RSA 21-J: 14.\n\nSource. #8570-A, eff 2-18-06",
